{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/infernal-exalted/1556872-about-the-splintered-separation","id":1556872,"title":"About the splintered separation","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Infernal Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2025-12-20T20:53:10-08:00","id":1556872,"title":"About the splintered separation","content":"few question about splintered gale legion:<br /> 1,can battle group use charms?<br /> 2,what the hell is the splintered gale separation in prerequisite is?<br /> 3,the battle groups' data count the infernal's artifact or not?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28906-hacky","name":"Hacky","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":1,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2025"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-12-21T08:46:15-08:00","id":1556874,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hacky</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/infernal-exalted/1556872-about-the-splintered-separation#post1556872\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">1,can battle group use charms?</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm gonna say no, both for general balance purposes and considering the nature of the prerequisite.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hacky</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">2,what the hell is the splintered gale separation in prerequisite is?</div> </div> </div> </div>An Essence 2 Dodge Charm that allows an Infernal to split off individual mortal duplicates of themselves.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hacky</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">3,the battle groups' data count the infernal's artifact or not?</div> </div> </div> </div>Again going by Splintered Gale Separation, duplicates get superficial duplicates of the Infernal's Artifacts that are otherwise mundane equipment.<br /> <br /> Even possessing Might 1 is pretty strong for a battle group that can be larger than Size 3 without too much difficulty, so they're coming out well even without full on magic.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2025-12-29T01:15:33-08:00","id":1557076,"title":"","content":"1. No. The duplicates as per Splintered Gale Separation are mortal. They're Essence 1, have no mote pools, and can't use Charms or the Infernal's magic. Splintered Gale Legion says nothing that overrides this. <br /> <br /> 2. It's the alternative Dodge Charm option to purchase it. Though it probably should list it before Universal Command Application or be in Dodge first I think.<br /> <br /> 3. Like Isator noted, any artifact equipment a duplicate has only looks like the original. Just mundane equipment. .","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>And stuff.<br /> <sub><a href=\"https://blaqueandstuff.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My DeviantArt Page</a> // <a href=\"http://blaqueandstuff.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My tumblr</a> // <a href=\"http://www.dropbox.com/sh/trxegr5hl27s1l5/AAAegBBzxbDhvk1YpYJqdhz8a?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3e Houserules</a></sub>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/353-blaque","name":"Blaque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar353_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2976"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}